// chriz-iwd-encounters 380: on top of Mebdinga's talk script. If she turns hostile
// without the talk (the tomb's trap or an attack on her team), she becomes mortal and
// the party knows of the soul (Know_Soul) as after the talk.

IF
  Allegiance(Myself,ENEMY)
  HasItem("MINHP1",Myself)
THEN
  RESPONSE #100
    SetInterrupt(FALSE)
    DestroyItem("MINHP1")
    SetGlobal("Know_Soul","GLOBAL",1)
    SetInterrupt(TRUE)
END
